{"lang": "ja_JP", "eventid": "main_17", "eventName": "相変臨界", "entryType": "MAINLINE", "storyCode": "EG-11", "avgTag": "幕間", "storyName": "時間の先で", "storyInfo": "プリースティスはケルシーの目を通して、この幼い文明を見つめ直すのだった。\n", "storyList": [{"id": 0, "prop": "HEADER", "attributes": {"key": "title_test", "is_skippable": "true", "fit_mode": "BLACK_MASK"}}, {"id": 1, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 2, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 3, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 4, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 5, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "60_g1_rhodescorridor_bc", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 6, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$m_sys_act1mainss_intro", "key": "$m_sys_act1mainss_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 7, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 8, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 9, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "Dr.{@nickname}、まだ詩集を選んでいるの？"}}, {"id": 10, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "いいえ、なんでもないわ。ちょうどある詩を思い出してね、それも中に入れていいかもしれないと思って。"}}, {"id": 11, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "聞いてみたい？"}}, {"id": 12, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 13, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 14, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 15, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 16, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "60_g3_cvilizationtombstone", "screenadapt": "coverall", "block": "true"}}, {"id": 17, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 18, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.4, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 19, "prop": "Sticker", "attributes": {"id": "st1", "multi": "true", "text": "たとえ星々が、私たちを想う情熱に燃え上がろうと、", "x": 300.0, "y": 230.0, "alignment": "center", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 700.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 20, "prop": "Sticker", "attributes": {"id": "st1", "multi": "true", "text": "\\n\\nそれに応えられない時、私たちはどう感じるだろうか？", "block": "true"}}, {"id": 21, "prop": "Sticker", "attributes": {"id": "st1", "multi": "true", "text": "\\n\\nいま星々を見上げても、とても口にできはしない。", "block": "true"}}, {"id": 22, "prop": "Sticker", "attributes": {"id": "st1", "multi": "true", "text": "\\n\\n一日中、ただ一つの星を想い続けていることなど。", "block": "true"}}, {"id": 23, "prop": "Sticker", "attributes": {"id": "st1"}}, {"id": 24, "prop": "Sticker", "attributes": {"id": "st1", "multi": "true", "text": "たとえすべての星々が、消え去るか死に絶えようと、", "x": 300.0, "y": 230.0, "alignment": "center", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 700.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 25, "prop": "Sticker", "attributes": {"id": "st1", "multi": "true", "text": "\\n\\n私は何もない空を見上げられるようにならねばならない。", "block": "true"}}, {"id": 26, "prop": "Sticker", "attributes": {"id": "st1", "multi": "true", "text": "\\n\\nそして、漆黒たる宇宙の崇高さを感じるようになるだろう。", "block": "true"}}, {"id": 27, "prop": "Sticker", "attributes": {"id": "st1", "multi": "true", "text": "\\n\\nそうなるには、少し時間がかかるかもしれないが。", "block": "true"}}, {"id": 28, "prop": "Sticker", "attributes": {"id": "st1", "multi": "true", "text": "\\n\\n……", "block": "true"}}, {"id": 29, "prop": "Sticker", "attributes": {"id": "st1"}}, {"id": 30, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.4, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 31, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 32, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 33, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "bg_black", "screenadapt": "coverall", "block": "true"}}, {"id": 34, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 35, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 36, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "そう……これがあなたの一万年にも及ぶ旅路だったのね。"}}, {"id": 37, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "私はあなたをどう捉え直すべきかしら、AMa-10……"}}, {"id": 38, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "それとも……ケルシーと呼ぶべき？"}}, {"id": 39, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 40, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 41, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 42, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 43, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "60_g4_rhodesabyss_w", "screenadapt": "coverall", "block": "true"}}, {"id": 44, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 45, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 46, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "あなたの行動は、源石計画に少なからぬ障害をもたらしたわ。けれど、あなたの視線を追うことこそが、今のテラ文明を理解する一番の近道なのかもしれないわね。"}}, {"id": 47, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "なるほど……"}}, {"id": 48, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "PCSシステム、「保存者」の生命維持ポッド、生き残った巨獣、損壊したスターゲート……いくつもの壊れてしまった遺物が、こんな形で新たな文明を創り上げていたなんてね。"}}, {"id": 49, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "予想外の結果だけれど、あまりにも荒唐無稽でむしろ面白いくらいだわ。"}}, {"id": 50, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "でも最も重要なのは、源石がそれらの生命の在り方を変え、彼らを私たちの文明とよく似た道へと導いたことよ。"}}, {"id": 51, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "Dr.{@nickname}、タロⅡから生命の火種を呼び寄せたのはあなたの独断だったけど、この結果はあなたの期待通りかしら？"}}, {"id": 52, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 53, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 54, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 55, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 56, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "bg_23_G07", "screenadapt": "coverall", "block": "true"}}, {"id": 57, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 58, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 59, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "見えたわ……"}}, {"id": 60, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "原始的で危機から遠く離れた環境が、生命に野性的な成長の余地を残し、様々な形の文明へと進化させた。これは、失われた時代には久しく見られなかった光景ね……"}}, {"id": 61, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "それが感動的な出来事であることは、理解できないわけじゃない。"}}, {"id": 62, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "けれど、まさか……本当にたったそれだけのことだと言うの？"}}, {"id": 63, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 64, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 65, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 66, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 67, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "bg_cenbri", "screenadapt": "coverall", "block": "true"}}, {"id": 68, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 69, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 70, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "あなたは覚えていたはずよ。大きな希望を託された計画が、終末の中で何度灰燼に帰してきたか。同胞たちが、終極の闇を打ち破るためにどれだけの犠牲を払ってきたか。"}}, {"id": 71, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "ただでさえ残り少なかった希望が際限なくすり減らされていく様は、極めて残酷なものだったわ。"}}, {"id": 72, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "それに比べて、このちっぽけな星で、未だに言語や文化が隔たりを生み、政治によって戦争が引き起こされているような原始的な文明を……どうして「希望」だなんて呼べるの？"}}, {"id": 73, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 74, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 75, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 76, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 77, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "bg_black", "screenadapt": "coverall", "block": "true"}}, {"id": 78, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 79, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 80, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "私にはわからないわ。一体何があなたをそれほど納得させたのかしら……"}}, {"id": 81, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 82, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 83, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 84, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 85, "prop": "image", "attributes": {"image": "49_i22", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 86, "prop": "ImageTween", "attributes": {"xScaleFrom": 1.2, "yScaleFrom": 1.2, "xScaleTo": 1.0, "yScaleTo": 1.0, "duration": 40.0, "block": "false"}}, {"id": 87, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 88, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 89, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 3.5}}, {"id": 90, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 91, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 92, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 93, "prop": "image", "attributes": {"image": "27_i31", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 94, "prop": "ImageTween", "attributes": {"xScaleFrom": 1.0, "yScaleFrom": 1.0, "xScaleTo": 1.1, "yScaleTo": 1.1, "duration": 40.0, "block": "false"}}, {"id": 95, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 96, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 97, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 3.5}}, {"id": 98, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 99, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 100, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 101, "prop": "image", "attributes": {"image": "44_i12_1", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 102, "prop": "ImageTween", "attributes": {"xScaleFrom": 1.0, "yScaleFrom": 1.0, "xScaleTo": 1.1, "yScaleTo": 1.1, "duration": 40.0, "block": "false"}}, {"id": 103, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 104, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 105, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 3.5}}, {"id": 106, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 107, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 3.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 108, "prop": "image", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 109, "prop": "verticalbg", "attributes": {"imagegroup": "66_i18_4/66_i18_3/66_i18_2/66_i18_1", "solidwidth": 1280.0, "solidheight": "720/720/720/720", "y": 1200.0}}, {"id": 110, "prop": "largebgtween", "attributes": {"duration": 50.0, "yFrom": 1200.0, "yTo": 0.0, "block": "false"}}, {"id": 111, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 112, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 4.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 113, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 114, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 3.5}}, {"id": 115, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 116, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 3.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 117, "prop": "verticalbg", "attributes": {"imagegroup": "38_g17_2/38_g17_1", "solidwidth": 1280.0, "solidheight": "1116.25/1117.5", "x": 0.0, "y": 920.0}}, {"id": 118, "prop": "largebgtween", "attributes": {"duration": 13.0, "yFrom": 920.0, "yTo": 0.0, "block": "false"}}, {"id": 119, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 120, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 4.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 121, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 122, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 3.5}}, {"id": 123, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 124, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 125, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 126, "prop": "verticalbg", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 127, "prop": "image", "attributes": {"image": "49_i07", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 128, "prop": "ImageTween", "attributes": {"xScaleFrom": 1.2, "yScaleFrom": 1.2, "xScaleTo": 1.0, "yScaleTo": 1.0, "duration": 40.0, "block": "false"}}, {"id": 129, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 130, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 131, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 3.5}}, {"id": 132, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "そうだったのね……"}}, {"id": 133, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "文明が荒廃した長い時の中で、偉大と呼ぶに値する瞬間が痕跡を残していたのね。まるで、あっという間に燃え尽きる恒星のように。"}}, {"id": 134, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "なんてことかしら。ルゥはすでに自身の無邪気な計画に固執していないし、フリストンでさえ、希望を明け渡す道を選んだなんて。"}}, {"id": 135, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "AMa-10、これがあなたの未練なのね？"}}, {"id": 136, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "そして、これがあなたの理由なのね……Dr.{@nickname}。"}}, {"id": 137, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "彼らの文明の中に、かつての私たちにも似た、抗う姿を見た……ただそれだけ？"}}, {"id": 138, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 139, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 140, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 141, "prop": "image", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 142, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 143, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "60_g4_rhodesabyss_w", "screenadapt": "coverall", "block": "true"}}, {"id": 144, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 145, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 146, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "それじゃ足りない。全然足りないわ。"}}, {"id": 147, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "あなたのその感情は理解できるわ。けれど、彼らの存続のために私が道を譲る理由としては不十分よ。"}}, {"id": 148, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "私たちに残された時間は限られているの。源石の成長にはもっと多くの土地と時間が必要なのに、終末はもう目前まで迫っている。"}}, {"id": 149, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "もし……もしあなたが、彼らならいつか必ずあの帳すら引き剥がせると信じているのなら、彼らは目の前のこの取るに足らない障害くらい乗り越え、自身の限界さえも超えてみせるべきよ。"}}, {"id": 150, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "さあ、存分に証明してみせて。"}}, {"id": 151, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 152, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 3.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 153, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 154, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 155, "prop": "Image", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 156, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": ""}}], "OPTIONTRACE": true}